  "planes": "text-only (i, i, i); picture of H x W merged tokens at token_offset P: i <= P -> (i, i, i), k-th picture token -> (P+1, P+1 + k // W, P+1 + k % W), i >= P+N+1 -> i - (N - max(H, W))",
